<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 168 0 R
/T (chatbot technology evolves, more accurate and faster intent recognition would improve the user experience and even be more used in businesses. Another product improvement of chatbot technology includes the ability for a chatbot to recognize multiple languages. As many customer service and user interactions methods are now open to different languages, this practice could be applied to chatbot technology. The ability for a chatbot to recognize multiple languages makes chatbot technology and user assistance more accessible as it reaches a wider audience. While chatbot technology is continuing to develop and evolve, it still functions as a viable method of user assistance and customer service in the absence of human interaction.)
/E (chatbot technology evolves, more accurate and faster intent recognition would improve the user experience and even be more used in businesses. Another product improvement of chatbot technology includes the ability for a chatbot to recognize multiple languages. As many customer service and user interactions methods are now open to different languages, this practice could be applied to chatbot technology. The ability for a chatbot to recognize multiple languages makes chatbot technology and user assistance more accessible as it reaches a wider audience. While chatbot technology is continuing to develop and evolve, it still functions as a viable method of user assistance and customer service in the absence of human interaction.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
