/Title (Chatbot technology and human interaction are currently not comparable. At this point, chatbot technology is not developed to the point of it competing with traditional customer service. The functionality of both is slightly different and this keeps both from becoming obsolete at least in the near future. Chatbot technology is currently applied with the purpose of enhancing customer service of the business overall and providing alternate forms of service other than solely human interaction. Due to AI and chatbot technology evolving, the purpose and application is also evolving and may be more comparable to human interaction in future years. However, the current application of chatbot technology is such that users still prefer human interaction for its ease and efficiency, and chatbot technology is a backup method. Chatbot technology's contribution to customer service is that it provides a well rounded, constantly available user assistance, but cannot be solely relied on for customer service and instead for navigation.)
